{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3113","id":3333070930,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887GqqBS","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3113","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3113.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3113.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3113","number":3113,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: OIDC expiry 0 sets nil instead of far-future date","user":{"login":"cobyfrombrooklyn-bot","id":262706804,"node_id":"U_kgDOD6iWdA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262706804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobyfrombrooklyn-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #3111\n\n## Problem\n\nWhen `oidc.expiry` is set to `0` (meaning \"no expiry\"), headscale sets the node expiry to `MaxDuration` (~292 years in the future). This results in a far-future date like `2318-06-08` in the database instead of NULL. Clients like Headplane cannot distinguish this from a real expiry and fail to show the \"no expiry\" tag.\n\n## Fix\n\nThree changes:\n\n1. **`hscontrol/oidc.go` - `determineNodeExpiry`**: When `Expiry` equals `MaxDuration`, return zero time instead of adding 292 years to now.\n\n2. **`hscontrol/oidc.go` - `handleRegistration`**: When the computed expiry is zero time, pass `nil` (instead of `&expiry`) to `HandleNodeFromAuthPath`, resulting in NULL in the database. This is consistent with how `IsExpired()` already treats nil expiry as \"not expired\".\n\n3. **`hscontrol/types/config.go`**: Exported `MaxDuration` so it can be referenced from the `hscontrol` package.\n\n## Test\n\nAdded `TestDetermineNodeExpiry` with three test cases:\n- `zero_expiry_means_no_expiry`: verifies MaxDuration config returns zero time (fails without fix: returns year 2318)\n- `normal_expiry_returns_future_time`: verifies normal expiry still works\n- `use_token_expiry`: verifies UseExpiryFromToken still works\n\nTested locally on macOS ARM (Apple Silicon). All hscontrol tests pass.","created_at":"2026-02-26T21:49:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-26T21:49:26Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"log